{"completed": true, "response": "他已经想好要让对方知道什么，也明白说出来可能会改变两人原本轻松自在的关系。可这份亲近本身就让他很满足，他并不想改变它。越觉得这段关系珍贵，他就越想把藏在心里的话告诉对方，但也越舍不得冒险打破现在的亲近。所以，他想说出来的心意越来越强烈，顾虑却始终还在。这不是他又开始怀疑自己的感情，也不是他突然想明白了该怎么处理这件事，而是他对这段关系的珍惜和想要表达的渴望都越来越深，彼此影响，却还没有让他真正决定要不要行动。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "24730a70-8fea-4427-950d-8a30ada2e48a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003354341090Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.891, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:34:02.233564+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "feaf8a84d62faf851891bd18746688c7e069f1733e9e7ef3612b79a85aa001b2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003354341090Z", "files": ["pr